    "user": "Shelby Cummings",
    "role": "student",
    "text": "The methodology should focus on the things, that must be done to answer the RQs, and only them. Listing various models that may be tested with users dilutes the focus. Restrict yourself two or maybe more models and argue for der sufficiency.",
